Current Dev Position: YP 2.5 M3 development

Next Deadline: YP 2.5 M3 cut off is 2/19/18


SWAT team rotation: Paul -> Tracy on Feb. 9, 2018.

SWAT team rotation: Tracy -> Stephano on Feb. 16, 2018.

https://wiki.yoctoproject.org/wiki/Yocto_Build_Failure_Swat_Team


Key Status/Updates:

=B7         YP 2.5 M2 is currently undergoing QA and nearly complete. See: =
https://wiki.yoctoproject.org/wiki/2.5_QA_Status

=B7         YP 2.2.3 is also mostly through QA. See https://wiki.yoctoproje=
ct.org/wiki/2.2_QA_Status.  T

=B7         Holidays mean that QA is slowed, we will QA 2.4.2 as soon as th=
ey return.

=B7         autobuilder.yoctoproject.org continues to be unavailable as we =
continue to develop the new autobuilder codebase to replace the current hea=
vily customized buildbot one.

=B7         Some positive performance news is that by removing the =93fetch=
all=94 and =93checkuriall=94 tasks, we were able to take =93bitbake core-im=
age-sato -g=94 from 20s to around 8s. The speedup comes from the runqueue c=
alculation so most builds will benefit from this speedup. The tasks are rep=
laced by a dedicated bitbake option, --runall=3D<taskname>.

=B7         Kernel updates have been blocked as some image sizes have overf=
lowed the maximum allowed image sizes. We=92re working on figuring out how =
to resolve that, likely by stripping ltp and/or optimising the kernel-devsr=
c recipe if possible.

=B7         The glibc change is blocked on various build failures the code =
seems to trigger as well as issues with gplv2 vs gplv3 patches for meta-gpl=
v2.


Planned upcoming dot releases:

YP 2.4.2 (Rocko) will be built shortly, once there is QA bandwidth availabl=
e.

YP 2.3.4 (Pyro) will be built when we figure out gcc backports.

YP 2.2.3 (Morty) rc2 is in QA.

YP 2.2.4 (Morty) will be built when we figure out gcc backports.


Key YP 2.5 Dates are:

YP 2.5 M2 cut off is past, it is in QA.

YP 2.5 M2 release of 1/26/18

YP 2.5 M3 cut off of 2/19/18

YP 2.5 M3 release of 3/2/18

YP 2.5 M4 cut off of 4/2/18

YP 2.5 M4 release of 4/27/18


Tracking Metrics:

            WDD 2610 (last week 2638)

(https://wiki.yoctoproject.org/charts/combo.html)


Key Status Links for YP:

https://wiki.yoctoproject.org/wiki/Yocto_Project_v2.5_Status

https://wiki.yoctoproject.org/wiki/Yocto_2.5_Schedule

https://wiki.yoctoproject.org/wiki/Yocto_2.5_Features


